1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,440
好了 各位 蛋糕时间
Okay, everybody. Cake time!

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,080
老天 我真的得去学习
Thank god. I really have to study.

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,580
亲爱的 你就不能抽出点时间享用吗
Oh, sweetheart, can't you just take a minute to enjoy it?

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,420
这可是你的生日啊
It's your birthday.

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,760
你给自己施加太多压力了
You put too much pressure on yourself.

6
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,460
我还记得我16岁那年
I remember my sweet 16.

7
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,880
我想要个主题派对
I wanted a theme party.

8
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,180
《月色撩人》刚刚上映 但我还没出柜
"Moonstruck" had just come out, but I hadn't, so --

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,540
别讲故事 没时间听
No stories, no time --

10
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,240
我是要考大学入学考试的人啊
S.A.T.s.

11
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,320
来吧 各位
Here we go, everybody.

12
00:00:19,177 --> 00:00:19,860
等等 等等
Wait, wait.

13
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,140
我们都知道在庆祝什么
We all know why we're here.

14
00:00:21,742 --> 00:00:23,642
-亲爱的 你落下了一根 -我知道
- Ay, honey, you missed one. - I know!

15
00:00:23,938 --> 00:00:27,178
我知道我落下了一根 我不是傻子
I know I missed one! I'm not an idiot!

16
00:00:27,178 --> 00:00:28,477
这样 开心了吧
There! Happy?!

17
00:00:28,952 --> 00:00:31,000
-你有点... -失控是吗
- You're being a little... - Obstreperous?!

18
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,120
顽抗 还是野蛮
Recalcitrant?! Truculent?!

19
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,873
我本来想说"神经兮兮"
I was gonna say "Cray-cray."

20
00:00:33,873 --> 00:00:34,800
艾丽克斯 亲爱的
Alex, sweet...

21
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,720
我真的得集中精神
I really need to focus!

22
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,080
有个16岁的科学天才
There is a 16-year-old science prodigy

23
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,900
在约翰·霍普金斯大学做癌症研究
studying cancer research at Johns Hopkins!

24
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,680
16岁 瞧瞧我在干什么
16! What am I doing?!

25
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,620
我在吃蛋糕
I'm eating cake!

26
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:44,820
别这样 别这样
No, no, no.

27
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:47,352
蛋糕 蛋糕 蛋糕
Cake! Cake! Cake!

28
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:02,220
艾丽克斯在昨晚过后 可能会有点脆弱
Alex might be a little bit fragile after last night,

29
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,340
所以我们得小心对待她
so let's try to be sensitive.

30
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,980
相信我 从现在起
Oh, believe me -- I am going to be

31
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:06,920
我都会对她耐心又友好
nothing but nice to Alex from now on.

32
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,380
如果她哪天突然崩溃 实施暴行
If she snaps and goes on a rampage,

33
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,680
你觉得她会最先找上谁
who do you think she's coming for first?

34
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,600
她不会实施暴行的
She's not going on a rampage.

35
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,322
我赌她会留我一命 她喜欢我
I bet she'd let me live. She likes me.

36
00:01:13,322 --> 00:01:14,993
坦白说 我从不信任她
I'm just gonna say it -- I never trusted her.

37
00:01:14,993 --> 00:01:16,360
大家都正常一点就行了
Oh, everybody just be normal.

38
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:18,440
我们要像平时那样对她
We're gonna treat her exactly the way we usually do.

39
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,200
她来了
And there she is.

40
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:22,040
-美女 -你睡得怎么样
- Hi, pretty girl. - How'd you sleep?

41
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:24,660
-不错 -你的头发看起来超柔软 小艾
- Fine. - Your hair looks super-soft, Al.

42
00:01:24,660 --> 00:01:27,200
那是新的毛衣吗 超爱
And is that a great new sweater? Love!

43
00:01:27,304 --> 00:01:28,680
老爸 你能把黄油刀递给我吗
Dad, can you hand me the butter knife?

44
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,060
不行
No!

45
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:31,383
海莉 卢克 请上楼去
Haley, Luke, upstairs, please.

46
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:32,080
谢谢
Thank you.

47
00:01:34,498 --> 00:01:35,394
谢谢
Thanks.

48
00:01:35,467 --> 00:01:36,942
好吧 谈谈我昨晚的失控
So, about my meltdown.

49
00:01:36,942 --> 00:01:38,020
-谁 -什么失控
- Who? - What meltdown?

50
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:41,240
我想去看心理医生 我查了一下
I want to see a therapist. I did some research.

51
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:43,000
格雷戈里·克拉克医生 超高推荐度
Dr. Gregory Clark -- highly recommended,

52
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,500
专治青少年 在我们的医保范围内
specializes in teenagers, and is covered by our insurance.

53
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:47,360
我预约了今天找他看两个钟
I booked a double session with him today.

54
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,860
既然你们今天要参加学校开放日
And since you guys have the open house,

55
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,500
我自己坐公交去
I will be taking the bus.

56
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,700
-好 -听起来不错
- Okay. - That sounds good.

57
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:57,120
她简直像个自动清洁炉
She's like a self-cleaning oven.

58
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,080
快看看
Check it out.

59
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:02,480
我今天要以复古造型亮相开放日
I'm rockin' the old school for the open house today.

60
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:04,540
我要为体育课重新注入活力
I'm gonna put the "Fizz" back in "Phys Ed."

61
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:06,280
我喜欢 全都喜欢
I love it -- all of it.

62
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:06,860
-真的吗 -当然
- Really? - Yeah.

63
00:02:06,860 --> 00:02:08,480
因为我今天想给家长们留下个好印象
Because I want to make a good impression today.

64
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,520
我想成为所有家长谈论的对象
I want to be the teacher all the parents are talking about.

65
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,820
是啊 难怪穿这袜子
Well, that explains the socks.

66
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:12,737
什么
What?

67
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,740
学校里有一种等级制度
There's a caste system at school --

68
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,800
学术教师在顶层 体育教师在底层
Academic teachers at the top, gym teachers at the bottom.

69
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:19,540
真的很讨厌 也很无礼
It's offensive and disrespectful.

70
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:21,020
他们像对待服务员一样对待我们
They treat us like we're lunch ladies.

71
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:23,380
你好啊 邻居
Hey, there, neighbor.

72
00:02:24,909 --> 00:02:26,351
-是亚瑟 对吧 -没错
- It's Asher, right? - Yeah.

73
00:02:26,351 --> 00:02:28,040
我就是想告诉你
Um, I just wanted to let you know --

74
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:28,740
我觉得你们家的空调
I think there might be something

75
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:30,420
-可能坏了 -是吗
- wrong with your air conditioner. - Oh, really?

76
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:32,160
是啊 好像总是开着
Yeah, I mean, it just seems to be running a lot,

77
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,400
即便屋外还挺凉快的
even when it's, uh, kind of cool outside.

78
00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:35,460
不是 不是
No, no.

79
00:02:35,501 --> 00:02:37,260
我家那位有点怕热
Um, my partner runs a little hot.

80
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,440
那也没我们这个地球热
Not as hot as our planet.

81
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:40,920
抱歉 我没想那么刻薄
Sorry. I don't mean to be that guy.

82
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:43,520
只是 我们都在一个星球上
It's just, um, we're all in this together.

83
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,220
是啊 我开的是普锐斯车 所以
Yeah, I drive a Prius, so...

84
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,340
这倒是个不错的态度
And that's a nice little gesture.

85
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,080
我的车用的是回收的食用油
My car runs on reclaimed cooking oil.

86
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,640
我有一些相关文章 可以借你看
I have some literature, if you want it.

87
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:51,020
不用了 省纸吧
That's okay. Save the paper.

88
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:52,900
我从2004年起就没有印过任何东西
I haven't printed anything since 2004.

89
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:53,681
我打算发电邮给你
I was gonna e-mail you.

90
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:54,940
用你那高耗电的电脑吗
On your power-hungry computer?

91
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,240
我整座房子都是用太阳能供电的
My entire house is solar-powered.

92
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,740
我把电卖回给电网
I sell energy back to the grid

93
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:58,980
然后用那笔钱救北极熊
and use that money to save polar bears.

94
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,880
我是个环保律师
I'm an environmental lawyer,

95
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,160
所以我也是非常环保[绿色]的
so, you know, I'm pretty green.

96
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,400
你的草地也是嘛
So is your lawn.

97
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,400
我的庭院是抗干旱的
I went drought-tolerant --

98
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,280
多肉植物 本地植物 岩石庭院
Succulents, indigenous plants, rock garden.

99
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:12,100
我另一个爸爸说你的庭院像猫砂箱
My other daddy says your yard looks like a litter box.

100
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,540
她真是个可爱的孩子
She's a cute kid.

101
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,700
我还记得她穿一次性尿布时的样子
I remember when she was in disposable diapers.

102
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:21,900
你准备好了吗
Are you ready?

103
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:22,680
好了
Yeah.

104
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,200
你穿这么漂亮干嘛 跟我不搭啊
Why do you look like that when I look like this?

105
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:26,720
我朋友说那是因为你有钱
My friends say it's because of your money.

106
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:29,160
不 我是说 不过是个学校开放日
No, I'm just saying why is she all dressed up

107
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,140
干嘛盛装打扮
for a school open house?

108
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:32,260
我想给曼尼的历史老师留下深刻印象
I want to impress Manny's history teacher.

109
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:34,180
我想让曼尼去华盛顿
I want Manny to go to Washington, D.C.

110
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,360
是的 参加青少年国会
Yeah, Junior Congress.

111
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,620
整个年级只有一个名额
Only one kid in the whole grade gets picked to go.

112
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,220
我觉得我能有所作为
I think I can make a difference.

113
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:42,240
得了吧 真的国会都只是个摆设而已
Regular Congress can't even make a difference.

114
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:43,640
别担心 曼尼 包在我身上
Don't worry, Manny. I have it covered.

115
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:45,780
你只管去好好约会吧
You just go and enjoy your date.

116
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:48,160
我确实有个约会 没什么大不了
I have a date. It's no big deal.

117
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,314
你不要大惊小怪
D-don't make a whole thing about it.

118
00:03:49,314 --> 00:03:50,360
我的车钥匙哪儿去了
What did I do with my car keys?

119
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,520
我们还只是朋友而已
I mean, we're just friends now,

120
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,560
但我有很好的预感
but I have a good feeling.

121
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:53,920
好吧 我知道不应该言之过早
I know -- don't get ahead of myself.

122
00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:55,120
每次一放下都找不着了
Every time I put them down.

123
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:56,060
她叫什么名字
What is her name?

124
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:57,320
要么是佐伊 要么就是派珀
Either Zoe or Piper.

125
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,700
你怎么连约会对象的名字都不知道呢
How can you be going on a date and you don't know her name?

126
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,200
这就是有意思的地方啊
This is where it gets interesting.

127
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:03,100
我深表怀疑
I seriously doubt that.

128
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:05,940
几天前我们差点因为一个女孩争风吃醋
A few days ago, we almost let a girl come between us.

129
00:04:08,420 --> 00:04:10,693
-那是谁 -新来的姑娘
- Who is she? - The new girl.

130
00:04:10,889 --> 00:04:13,020
-好漂亮 -美极了
- She's pretty. - Super-pretty.

131
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:13,160
我要了
Dibs.

132
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:15,460
什么 不 你不能这样
What?! N-no. You can't call dibs.

133
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:16,760
她是个有情感的大活人
She's a human being with feelings,

134
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,700
这不是在抢前排座位
not the front seat.

135
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:19,740
接着奇迹发生了
Then a miracle happened.

136
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:22,800
双胞胎 一样的美丽动人
Twins -- each as pretty as the other.

137
00:04:24,340 --> 00:04:26,240
这很有趣 因为卢克和我一般
It's funny -- Luke and I don't usually

138
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,260
不会看上同一类型的女孩
go for the same kind of girl.

139
00:04:27,260 --> 00:04:30,970
没错 我喜欢的类型是"容易上手型"
Yeah. I like to describe my type as "Gettable".

140
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:35,880
你在干什么 塔克
What are you doing, Tucker?

141
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,260
你好啊 布朗校长
Oh, hey, Principal Brown.

142
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:40,500
你知道其他的老师总是给家长
Do you know how other teachers drone on and on

143
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:41,780
讲那些枯燥无趣的老生常谈
to parents with their boring lectures?

144
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,360
我觉得我可以另辟蹊径
Well, I thought I would go another way.

145
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:46,440
听上去可不大妙
Oh. Well, I don't like the sound of that at all.

146
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:47,160
你一定会喜欢的
I think you will.

147
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:50,380
我打算来一堂躲避球课 活跃一下气氛
I'm gonna spice things up with a spirited game of dodgeball.

148
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:51,940
不要 千万不要 一百个不要
Oh, no. No, no, no, no, no.

149
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:53,220
在你说"不要"之前
Okay, before you say "No"...

150
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:54,000
我已经说了"不要"了
I already said "No."

151
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,080
先看看我的全套构思
...let me show you my whole bit.

152
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:57,220
你们好 伙计们
Howdy, folks.

153
00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:58,500
我名字叫塔克
My name's Tucker.

154
00:04:58,596 --> 00:05:01,949
是"多比"镇警官 其实是"躲避"球
I'm the Sheriff of Dodge...ball.

155
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:03,760
家长们会哄堂大笑
"Laugh, laugh, laugh."

156
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:04,420
然后
And then --

157
00:05:04,420 --> 00:05:05,940
不 没有然后 不行
No, no "then." No.

158
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:07,860
你看到那些家长的身材了吗
Have you seen the shape some of these folks are in?

159
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,780
我们可不想某个家长当场倒毙
We don't need a parent dropping dead in here.

160
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:11,140
这里是海豚湾体育馆
Look, this is the "Dolphin Den."

161
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,580
可没打算改名叫
I am not renaming it

162
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:14,400
曼德尔鲍姆纪念馆
the Harvey K. Mandelbaum memorial gym.

163
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:16,160
但我本来想把大家分成哈特菲尔德队
But I was gonna divide everybody up into

164
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,080
和麦考伊队打比赛呢
the Hatfield and McCoys.

165
00:05:17,460 --> 00:05:18,480
不许打躲避球
Just no dodgeball.

166
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,720
你好 英格拉姆老师
Hello, Mr. Ingram.

167
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,440
我是歌洛莉亚·德尔加多·迪尔加多
I am Gloria Delgado-Pritchett,

168
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:26,120
曼尼的妈妈
Manny's mother.

169
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,360
没错 当然了
Yes, of course.

170
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:28,980
我想好好感谢您
I just wanted to thank you so much.

171
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,860
我儿子对您评价极高
He thinks the world of you.

172
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:33,040
作为移民的小孩
You know, as a child of an immigrant,

173
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:36,540
您让他对世界有别具一格的新鲜看法
he can look at the world with such a fresh perspective.

174
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:38,220
提到"新鲜"
And talking about fresh,

175
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,680
我给你带了些墨西哥酥皮饺子
I brought you some empanadas.

176
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,220
真有一套啊
Subtle.

177
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:43,460
菲尔 克莱尔呢
Hey, Phil. Where's Claire?

178
00:05:43,460 --> 00:05:45,340
她去艾丽克斯的教室了
Oh, she's going to Alex's classes.

179
00:05:45,340 --> 00:05:45,960
我负责卢克这一边
I'm doing Luke's.

180
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,100
你居然来了我很惊讶
I'm surprised to see you here.

181
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:48,040
你的球队不是今天比赛吗
Isn't your team playing today?

182
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:49,440
就是啊 但歌洛莉亚非要我来
Yeah. Gloria made me come.

183
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,860
我设好了录像机
I think I'm recording the game,

184
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:52,200
但谁知道会发生什么意外情况
but, you know, you can never know.

185
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:54,440
上次我录了六小时的Bravo电视台的节目
The last time, I got six hours of Bravo.

186
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,560
万事皆有可能
And who knows?

187
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:58,780
保不准曼尼就是第一个拉丁裔总统呢
Maybe Manny's going to be the first Latino President.

188
00:05:59,660 --> 00:06:01,260
你好 英格拉姆老师
Hello, Mr. Ingram.

189
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:03,180
我是唐娜·邓肯医生
Dr. Donna Duncan,

190
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,380
韦斯利的妈妈
Wesley's mom.

191
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:06,580
一点小谢礼 不成敬意
Just brought you a little thank-you

192
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:09,020
因为您是我儿子最喜欢的老师
for being his absolute favorite teacher ever.

193
00:06:09,054 --> 00:06:12,077
-这些蛋糕够白的 -谢谢夸奖
- Those cupcakes are so white. - Thank you.

194
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,320
我是唐娜·邓肯医生
Dr. Donna Duncan.

195
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,140
我是歌洛莉亚
I'm Gloria.

196
00:06:14,780 --> 00:06:16,020
我们见过几次
We've met several times.

197
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,460
当然记得了
Oh, of course.

198
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,240
马里奥的妈妈
Mario's mom.

199
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,360
是曼尼
Manny.

200
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,720
他适应得怎么样 比以前好些吗
And how is he fitting in now? Better?

201
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:25,200
总之
Anyway...

202
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,660
我带了好东西
Here she is.

203
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:30,200
你带了个酒壶来学校开放日吗
You brought a flask to an open house?

204
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,660
想来点吗 苏格兰威士忌
You want some? It's Scotch.

205
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,680
不 拿远点
No. Put it away.

206
00:06:32,780 --> 00:06:34,060
别这么娘娘腔
Don't be such a goody-goody.

207
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,620
尝一口 这酒比你年纪还大
Taste it. It's older than you are.

208
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:38,140
-我才不想喝威士忌 -那就闻一下
- I don't want any scotch. - Well, just smell it.

209
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:40,960
-好 -邓菲先生 你拿的是酒壶吗
- Fine. - Mr. Dunphy, is that a flask?

210
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,788
不是 是 实际上
No. It is. It I--

211
00:06:42,788 --> 00:06:44,220
我只是 是他的
Uh, I was -- it's his.

212
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:44,960
才不是我的
No, it's not.

213
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:48,520
提醒一下 严禁带酒来学校
For the record, no alcohol is allowed on school premises.

214
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,340
你太不象话了 菲尔
For god's sake, Phil,

215
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:52,079
这才下午两点而已
it's 2:00 in the afternoon.

216
00:06:57,140 --> 00:07:00,780
艾丽克斯 跟我说说你为什么来这里
So, Alex, tell me why you're here.

217
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,620
我昨晚有点情绪失控
I had a little meltdown last night,

218
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:05,500
我害怕以后还会这样
and I'm afraid it'll happen again.

219
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,760
但下次没准会发生在大学入学考试过程中
But, this time, in the middle of the S.A.T or something.

220
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,420
那你为什么失控了呢
Why do you think you melted down?

221
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:10,600
我压力山大啊
I'm stressed.

222
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:12,120
我已经高三了
It's my junior year.

223
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:13,520
我觉得可能是
Part of me feels like

224
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:15,060
我的大脑边缘系统有点儿失灵
the limbic system in my brain's a bit off.

225
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,280
有这么一种病 对吧 我做过调研
That's a thing, right? I did some research.

226
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,880
你知道就算你自我诊断了
You know I charge the same

227
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,540
我也照旧收钱 对吧
even if you diagnose yourself?

228
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,820
我只想提高下效率
I'm just trying to move this along.

229
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:23,020
我还有很多事要做
I have a lot to do.

230
00:07:23,020 --> 00:07:25,640
治疗是讲究过程的
Well, uh, this is a process.

231
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:27,740
需要花些时间
You know, it takes some time.

232
00:07:28,705 --> 00:07:29,700
你在想什么
What -- what are you thinking?

233
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:32,000
-没什么 -没事 直说好了
- Nothing. - No, no. Go ahead. Tell me.

234
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,460
我觉得你可能帮不上我
That maybe you're not up for this.

235
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:34,960
无意冒犯
I mean, no offense.

236
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,880
只不过你看起来比网站上老很多
You're just a lot older than you look on your website.

237
00:07:37,007 --> 00:07:39,700
你上学那个年代有大学入学考试
Did you even have S.A.T.s when you were in high school

238
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:41,020
或是亚裔学生吗
or Asian kids?

239
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,220
那倒没有
Oh, no. no, no, no.

240
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:44,360
但也有其他事情让我很担心
But there were other things I worried about --

241
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,820
比如西班牙宗教法庭
Spanish inquisition,

242
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,500
出海寻找世界尽头
sailing off the edge of the world,

243
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:49,340
还要学习火到底是什么东西
learning how to understand fire.

244
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:50,460
抱歉
Sorry.

245
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,620
-不如我们换一种方式 -什么
- You mind if we try something? - What?

246
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,300
就当帮我的忙了
Just do me a favor.

247
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,560
深吸一口气
Take a deep breath.

248
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,560
很好
Great.

249
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:03,100
此时此刻 你在想什么
Now... what's on your mind?

250
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:07,800
我才想起来在离家之前
Well... I just remembered that I forgot

251
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,520
我忘了给电脑充上电了
to charge my computer before I left

252
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,460
而且我该在周一前买新的索引卡
and that I have to get new index cards before Monday.

253
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:12,880
希望还有蓝色的
Hopefully they don't run out of the blue ones,

254
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,580
因为不知为何蓝色的能帮助我学习
because, for some reason, those help me study better.

255
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,000
也许是因为它们读起来容易些
Maybe it's because they're easier to read

256
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,420
也许是因为我的药方不管用了
or maybe my prescription's getting worse.

257
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:18,980
我或许该去找我的眼科医生检查一下
I should probably make an appointment with the eye doctor.

258
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,700
还有 我这个暑假是不是该找个工作
Also, should I get a job this summer

259
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,640
实习经验会不会有利于我的申请
or would an internship look better on my application?

260
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,000
再有 希拉里到底是怎么了
And what is up with Hillary?

261
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,320
她到底要不要竞选
Is she going to run or not?

262
00:08:25,355 --> 00:08:27,180
我觉得她应该完全理解
I mean, I feel like she'd totally understand

263
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:28,520
被别人风头压在下面的感觉
the feeling of being overwhelmed,

264
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:31,100
但同时又觉得她没有尽最大努力
but also like you're not doing enough at the same time.

265
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:37,640
你好 妮娜 你家桑杰怎么样
Hey, Nina, how's Sanjay?

266
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,940
很好 谢谢关心
Oh, great. Thanks.

267
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:41,180
他在准备入学考试和大学测验
He's just dealing with the S.A.T.s and the A.C.T.s.

268
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:42,720
还有那个荣誉奖学金申请
And that merit scholarship application

269
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,960
每个人都在努力争取
everyone's so stressed about.

270
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,679
什么 什么申请
What -- what application?

271
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:48,180
我们从物理考试开始说起吧
Let's begin by talking about the A.P. Physics test,

272
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:50,500
你们都知道 这门考试安排在
which, as you know, takes place on...

273
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:51,900
5月21日
May 21st.

274
00:08:52,540 --> 00:08:53,320
卢克和海莉自理能力差
With Luke and Haley,

275
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:55,420
所以我要为他们安排好所有事
I'm on top of everything because they aren't.

276
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,660
但是艾丽克斯是那么的自立
But Alex is so self-sufficient,

277
00:08:58,060 --> 00:08:59,520
我就撒手让她自己干了[调到自动巡航模式]
I just sort of put it in cruise control.

278
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:02,120
我在方向盘那儿睡着了
I've fallen asleep at the wheel,

279
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:04,000
结果现在我的小天才往自己身上抹蛋糕
and now my little genius is covered in cake.

280
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,540
下面是我推荐学生
Now, a list of practice tests I recommend

281
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:08,040
在考试前做的习题
the students take before then

282
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:12,060
3a 4c 12a一直到f题
3a, 4c, 12a through "f,"

283
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:15,563
18d 19a 23c
18d, 19a, 23c,

284
00:09:15,563 --> 00:09:19,974
24g 25h 26a
24g, 25h, 26a...

285
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:22,480
同时 像鲍勃·迪伦这样伟大的艺术家
Meanwhile, a great artist like Bob Dylan

286
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,498
会在第一轮就出局
would get voted off in the first round, which --

287
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,300
如果你把吸管的一端弄湿
If you wet the end,

288
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,500
就会粘在他脸上
it will stick to his face.

289
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:28,540
你真是个天才
You're a genius.

290
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:30,196
派珀 那样做太无礼了
Piper, that's rude.

291
00:09:30,607 --> 00:09:31,577
曼尼 我们合唱队会唱
You know, Manny, in chorus,

292
00:09:31,577 --> 00:09:33,115
《随风飘荡》这首歌
we sing "Blowin' in the wind."

293
00:09:33,850 --> 00:09:35,564
这才叫做"随风飘荡"
Now that's blowin' in the wind.

294
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,380
你真风趣 卢克
You're funny, Luke.

295
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:39,340
曼尼和我要去趟洗手间
Manny and I need to use the restroom.

296
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:40,500
是吗
We do?

297
00:09:44,225 --> 00:09:45,200
你得跟我换换对象
You've got to switch with me.

298
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,640
什么 不行 我们不能那样做
What? No, we can't do that.

299
00:09:46,940 --> 00:09:48,400
她们是双胞胎 是不会发觉的
They're twins. They'll never notice.

300
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:50,480
你知道我们俩不是双胞胎吧
You realize we're not twins, right?

301
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,240
莉莉的娃娃屋特快专递来啦
Special dollhouse delivery for Lily!

302
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,380
来啦 来啦
It's here, it's here!

303
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,300
你绝对会爱上它的
I think you're going to love it.

304
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,460
我像你这么大的时候 整天都在玩这个
I spent so many hours playing with this when I was your age.

305
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:01,880
我也是
Yeah, me too.

306
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:02,900
快点把车熄火
Hey, quick, turn off your car.

307
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,180
怎么了 在停车模式上呢 我觉得
Why? It's in park, I think.

308
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:06,420
我有个邻居是环保人士
I have a judgey green neighbor.

309
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:07,980
他竟然有胆子跑过来
He had the nerve to come over here

310
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:09,260
跟我说我不够环保
and tell me that I'm not green enough.

311
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:11,060
不会吧 你超级环保的
Shut up! You're super-green.

312
00:10:11,077 --> 00:10:13,600
谢了 我回收利用了个娃娃屋
Thank you. I'm -- I'm recycling a dollhouse.

313
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,060
我甚至还"回收利用"了个孩子
I even recycled a child.

314
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:17,240
-你不是还赢了个奖吗 -对的对的
- Didn't you win some award? - Yes, yes.

315
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,860
州律师协会奖 为了表彰在环境法方面
The state bar association award for sustained excellence

316
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:20,960
做出长期卓越的贡
in the field of environmental...

317
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,900
对对对 就是这个
yeah, yeah, yeah. That's the one.

318
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,480
献 还有一个字没说完呢
...law. There was one word left.

319
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,440
你没有必要打断我
You didn't have to cut me off.

320
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:25,700
先把娃娃屋拿出来再说
Dollhouse, please.

321
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:27,076
好的 马上就好
Okay. Yeah, in a minute.

322
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:29,080
你知道该怎么做吗
You know what you should do?

323
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,560
去他家找他
March right over there

324
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,860
向他炫耀一下你的奖杯
and wave that trophy in his stupid eco face.

325
00:10:33,060 --> 00:10:34,220
不是吧 你真这么想吗
No. You think?

326
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:36,260
没错 这些人烦死了
Yes. Those people are so annoying.

327
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:37,460
我们学校有个女生
There's this girl at my school

328
00:10:37,460 --> 00:10:39,840
一直指责我说我的靴子是皮的
who was all over me about my boots 'cause they're leather.

329
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:41,720
可她自己还穿"鳄鱼牌"[洞洞鞋]
Meanwhile, she's wearing Crocs,

330
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,920
好像那就没有濒临灭绝一样
like those aren't endangered.

331
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:44,571
你知道么 我就要那么做
You know what? I am gonna do that.

332
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,540
让他知道我有多环保
Show him to out-green me.

333
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:48,791
-好吧 不 -不
- Okay. Oh, no. - Oh, no.

334
00:10:48,791 --> 00:10:50,279
都吹到他的院子里了
All right, those are blowing into his yard.

335
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,920
这 这绝对对我不利
That is -- okay, that's definitely gonna hurt my case.

336
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:53,622
你把这些捡起来
Uh, you pick these up.

337
00:10:53,622 --> 00:10:55,528
我去拿奖杯 莉莉 你帮她捡
I'm gonna go get the trophy. Lily, help her.

338
00:10:55,528 --> 00:10:57,872
我听到你说"回收小孩"的话了
I heard that "recycled child" comment.

339
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:02,260
多谢你的酒瓶
Thanks to your little flask,

340
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,560
现在老师认为我是个酒鬼
now the teacher thinks I'm a burnout.

341
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,620
橄榄球赛
Football game.

342
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:06,800
橄榄球赛
Football game!

343
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,520
-你在干吗 -现在可以语音搜索了
- What are you doing? - You can do this now.

344
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,420
我在广告上看到的
I saw it in a commercial.

345
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:10,280
那款手机做不到
Not with that phone.

346
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,580
跟对着钱包说效果一样
You might as well say it into your wallet.

347
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:13,040
快点 我们要赶不上数学课了
Come on. We're gonna be late for math.

348
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:15,000
我不会再去那些无聊的课了
I'm not going to any more boring classes.

349
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:15,800
你要半途而废吗
You're just gonna cut?

350
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:18,740
不 不去上课是因为我已经六十多了
No,I'm just not gonna go because I'm in my 60s.

351
00:11:19,260 --> 00:11:19,780
教师休息室
Teacher's lounge.

352
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,620
这里有台电视机
They got a TV in here.

353
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:24,320
-我们不能去教师休息室 -为什么不
- We can't go in the teacher's lounge. - Why not?

354
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,980
-因为那是老师专用的 -你就是老师
- Um, it's for teachers only. - You're a teacher.

355
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:28,920
你现在就在教我怎么做个小怨妇
Right now, you're teaching me how to be a little bitch.

356
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,540
杰 不要 杰
Jay, don't. Jay.

357
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:32,560
杰
Jay!

358
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,140
您大概什么时候做决定呢
So, when do you think you'll be making your decision?

359
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:40,500
下周左右吧
Oh, sometime in the next week or so.

360
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:43,300
慢慢来 逼您做决定是不礼貌的
Oh, take your time. It would be rude to rush you.

361
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:45,100
在别人谈话的时候插嘴
Not as rude as interrupting two people

362
00:11:45,100 --> 00:11:46,240
更没礼貌
in the middle of a conversation.

363
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,945
实际上我得走了
Well, actually, I'll go.

364
00:11:47,945 --> 00:11:49,620
我要喝点咖啡
I'm gonna go grab some coffee.

365
00:11:49,620 --> 00:11:52,620
就是 那些蛋糕看起来就很干
Good idea because those cupcakes look very dry.

366
00:11:53,217 --> 00:11:56,060
这简直让人难以置信
Okay. This is unbelievable.

367
00:11:56,060 --> 00:11:58,240
他们刚给了我四本关于申请名校的书
They just gave me four books on applying to top colleges.

368
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,040
我哪来的时间读完这些
When am I gonna have time to read all this?

369
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,060
天啊 真对不起
Oh, my gosh. I'm so sorry.

370
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:05,860
我没看到你 快来吧 各位
I didn't see you there. Come on, girls.

371
00:12:06,107 --> 00:12:08,180
她超过分的
Oh, she's so mean.

372
00:12:08,180 --> 00:12:10,060
-怎么可能有人注意不到我 -她是谁
- Everybody sees me. - Who was that?

373
00:12:10,060 --> 00:12:11,580
多达·达达医生
Dr. Dooda Dada.

374
00:12:11,580 --> 00:12:14,900
她以为可以靠色诱老师帮她儿子去华盛顿
She thinks that she can flirt her son all the way to Washington,

375
00:12:15,174 --> 00:12:16,644
我不会让她得逞的
but I'm gonna take her down.

376
00:12:16,644 --> 00:12:19,497
我很想跟你聊 可我得去微积分课
I would love to chat, but I got to get to A.P. Calc.

377
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:23,300
体育课是学校生活的重要部分
Physical education is a critical part of every school day.

378
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:26,100
我们学习知识的同时 也应该锻炼身体
As we develop the mind, so we must the body.

379
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:29,680
首先需要保证营养 勤做运动
This begins with good nutrition, uh, physical activity,

380
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,120
培养体育精神以及注重个人卫生
sportsmanship, and attention to personal hygiene.

381
00:12:32,220 --> 00:12:33,400
不 拜托你们不要走
No, please, please, please don't go.

382
00:12:33,580 --> 00:12:36,520
我知道这很无聊 可这不是我安排的
I know this is boring, but this isn't my idea.

383
00:12:36,660 --> 00:12:39,320
我本来想组织一场躲避球大赛 可是
I wanted to play a spirited game of dodgeball, but --

384
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:41,400
听起来很有趣 我要玩躲避球
That sounds fun. I'll play dodgeball.

385
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,580
我也要玩
I'll play, too.

386
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:45,380
任何东西都比讲这些有意思
Anything's got to be better than this.

387
00:12:45,580 --> 00:12:46,460
知道吗
Oh, well, you know what?

388
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:49,200
我们真的不应该那么做 可是知道吗
We're really not supposed to, but you know what?

389
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,140
各位 听着 我叫小卡
Hey, guys, listen to this. My name's Cam.

390
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:54,500
是"多比"镇警官 其实是"躲避"球
I'm the sheriff of Dodge...ball.

391
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:57,440
你们是哈特菲尔德队
Okay, you guys are the Hatfields.

392
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:58,560
你们是麦考伊队
You are the McCoys.

393
00:12:58,980 --> 00:13:00,360
曼德尔鲍姆先生 请您继续坐着
Mr. Mandelbaum, I'd like you to stay seated.

394
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,040
您来做我们的裁判就好
You're gonna be our referee.

395
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,840
好了 各位 躲避球大赛开始
All right, everybody, let's dodgeball!

396
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:06,980
躲避球比赛精彩极了
Dodgeball was a smash.

397
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:09,600
唐娜医生和歌洛莉亚像两个刺客
Dr. Donna and Gloria were like two assassins

398
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:12,420
把他们的目标一个一个干掉
just picking off their victims one by one.

399
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,260
终极躲避球对决
Okay, last two dodgeballers.

400
00:13:18,580 --> 00:13:19,360
准备好了吗
Are you ready?

401
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:20,380
准备好了
Yes.

402
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,180
准备好了吗
Are you ready?

403
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:23,260
准备好了
Yes!

404
00:13:25,020 --> 00:13:26,480
不好意思
Oh, I'm so sorry.

405
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:28,200
我要杀了你
I'm going to kill you!

406
00:13:28,275 --> 00:13:29,884
歌洛莉亚 歌洛莉亚不要激动
Gloria, Gloria, Gloria, don't!

407
00:13:29,977 --> 00:13:33,400
我的眼睛 你们怎么能这样
Ow! My eye! I don't understand you!

408
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:39,320
你喜欢戏剧
So, you like theater,

409
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,780
而你刚在薯条里放了根假拇指
and you just put this fake thumb in our fries.

410
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:42,540
没错
Yep.

411
00:13:43,547 --> 00:13:45,200
这么说也许有点冒险
I'm gonna go out on a limb here

412
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,420
可是我们也许约错人了
and say we're with the wrong people.

413
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,840
我们互换对象就解决问题了
Let's just switch dates and get this party started.

414
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,980
什么 我们不想换
What? We don't want to switch.

415
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:53,240
我对你没兴趣
Yeah. I'm not attracted to you.

416
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,080
我也对你没兴趣
And I'm not attracted to you.

417
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,880
等等
Wait a minute.

418
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,180
我们爱好相同但你却不喜欢我吗
We like all the same things, but you don't think I'm cute?

419
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:00,100
我对拉丁裔男生有好感
I've got a thing for Latin men.

420
00:14:00,217 --> 00:14:01,656
我喜欢呆一点的
I like 'em dumb.

421
00:14:01,762 --> 00:14:04,480
-这很伤人 -而且肤浅
- Ugh. Well, that's just offensive. - And shallow.

422
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,580
我们是男生不代表我们不会受伤
Just because we're guys doesn't mean we don't have feelings.

423
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:08,740
我觉得这不太好
Yeah. I don't feel good about this.

424
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,780
让我觉得
It makes me feel...

425
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:11,880
很糟
bad.

426
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,900
算了 卢克 我们走吧
Come on, Luke. Let's get out of here.

427
00:14:14,260 --> 00:14:15,280
我们的父母不在家
Our parents aren't home.

428
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:17,100
如果你们愿意 我们可以和你们亲热下
If you want, we'll make out with you.

429
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:20,360
接下来发生的事我并不引以为豪
I'm not proud of what happened next.

430
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,580
我觉得很好
I am.

431
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:27,140
他不在家
He's not home.

432
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,220
你打扫得怎样了
How's the cleanup going?

433
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:31,460
我觉得大部分搞定了
Well, I think I got most of them.

434
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:32,360
你搞了这么久
You've been at this a while.

435
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:34,120
怎么只捡了八个塑料球呢
How come you only have like eight peanuts?

436
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,500
我只是没有把它们抱着到处走
Instead of carrying them around,

437
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,977
我把它们都堆在那里
I made a huge pile right over th--

438
00:14:38,923 --> 00:14:41,209
-又来 -天哪 到处都是
- Again?! - Geez. They're everywhere.

439
00:14:41,299 --> 00:14:43,132
天哪 不 有只鸟
Oh, god. No! Bird!

440
00:14:43,635 --> 00:14:44,431
不要啊
Aah! Oh, no!

441
00:14:44,431 --> 00:14:45,548
不 不 不 不
Oh, no! No, no, no, no, no!

442
00:14:45,548 --> 00:14:47,300
不 这是什么味道
Oh, no! What is that smell?!

443
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,140
闻起来像炸薯条
It smells like french fries!

444
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,534
这是生物柴油 你能把它塞起来吗
It's biodiesel. Can you plug it up?

445
00:14:50,534 --> 00:14:53,496
-用什么塞 爆米花吗 -天哪
- Oh, what? With what? Popcorn? - Oh, geez. Oh, god.

446
00:14:53,496 --> 00:14:55,720
不 我的靴子 真是场灾难
No! My boots! This is a disaster!

447
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,600
保护海豹
Save the seals!

448
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:58,075
什么 什么情况
What -- what -- what -- what the hell?

449
00:14:58,700 --> 00:14:59,680
你们做了什么
What did you do?

450
00:15:01,405 --> 00:15:02,856
我赢过一座环保奖杯
Uh, I won a green award.

451
00:15:03,020 --> 00:15:03,600
就是这样
That's what.

452
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:07,540
你确定你能修好这东西吗
You think you can get this thing to work?

453
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:08,740
你应该去放哨的
Hey, you're supposed to be the lookout.

454
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,800
有人进来了怎么办
What if somebody walks in?

455
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:10,940
他们会打给我父母
Gee, they'll call my parents.

456
00:15:11,585 --> 00:15:13,520
看 你成功了
Hey! Look! You did it!

457
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,820
是啊 不是很复杂
Yeah, it's not that big of a deal.

458
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,000
听着 我要回课堂了
Listen, I'm gonna get back to class.

459
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:17,560
你走之前 我有个问题想问你
Before you go, let me ask you a question.

460
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:20,940
你怎么会这么擅长修理东西呢
How do you know how to do all this stuff?

461
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:23,220
高中时 我是影音俱乐部的
Back in high school, I was in the A.V. Club.

462
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:24,660
我们做过很多疯狂的事情
We did all kinds of crazy things.

463
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,860
有一年 我们在体育馆藏了一台麦克风
One year, we hid a microphone in the gym.

464
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:28,960
毕业舞会发生的事情我们都能听到
We could totally hear everything that was going on at prom.

465
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:31,026
我曾经取笑过你们这种人
I used to make fun of guys like you.

466
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:32,960
但这很酷
This is pretty cool.

467
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,020
真的吗
Really?

468
00:15:35,580 --> 00:15:36,700
你觉得这就算酷了
You think this is cool...

469
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,360
第一次进攻 好样的
First down! All right.

470
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,260
史上最棒的学校开放日
Best open house ever.

471
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:45,360
在影音俱乐部里一切都轻而易举
It's all gravy when you're in the A.V.

472
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:46,540
承认吧 打破些规则
Admit it -- doesn't it feel good

473
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:47,660
游走在制度边缘
to break a few rules,

474
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,860
是不是感觉挺好
take a walk on the wild side?

475
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,680
-不用谢 -不 是你不用谢
- You're welcome. - No, you're welcome.

476
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,200
这些都是我搞的
I'm the one who set this whole thing up.

477
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:54,100
不如说我们配合得不错吧
Let's just say we make a good team.

478
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,000
敬我们
To us.

479
00:15:55,940 --> 00:15:57,120
他进攻了 进攻了
There he goes. There he goes.

480
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,283
上啊 上啊 上啊
Come on, come on! Come on!

481
00:15:58,637 --> 00:16:00,104
上啊 漂亮
Come on! Yeah!

482
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:07,280
从我记事起我就是这个样子了
I've been like this for as long as I can remember.

483
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:08,900
能给我举个例子吗
Can you give me an example?

484
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:11,440
在我很小的时候
Well, when I was little,

485
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:13,020
是拼写队的成员
I was in a spelling team at school

486
00:16:13,020 --> 00:16:15,580
我真的很想赢
and I really wanted to win.

487
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,920
我也不知道为什么 也没有奖励
I don't know why. There was no prize.

488
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:19,000
没人在乎
No one cared.

489
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,300
我父母甚至都不知道我参加了
My parents didn't even know I was in it.

490
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,540
我只是觉得肩上有这样的责任
I just felt this weight on my shoulders,

491
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:26,560
就好像如果输了 我会 我也不知道
like if I lost, I'd...I don't know.

492
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:28,420
-我就是必须要赢 -那你赢了吗
- I just had to win. - And did you?

493
00:16:28,620 --> 00:16:30,700
是的 你知道决胜的词是什么吗
Yep. Know what the winning word was?

494
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:32,280
责任
Responsibility.

495
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,440
你是那么想的吗
Is that what you feel?

496
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:40,020
一直有着需要赢的责任
A responsibility to win all the time?

497
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:41,200
永远要做最好的
To always be the best?

498
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:43,220
你可以这么说
That's one way to put it.

499
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:46,180
这种责任 从哪里来
And this responsibility -- where does it come from?

500
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:49,560
我也不知道 它就自然存在了
I'm not sure. It's just...there.

501
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,940
所以这是种内部压力
So it's an internal pressure.

502
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:56,420
算是吧
Kind of.

503
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:58,840
一旦你做得超过预期了
I mean, once you start overachieving,

504
00:16:58,980 --> 00:17:00,360
人们就开始对你有所期待
people expect things from you.

505
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:01,380
人们是谁
Like what people?

506
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,960
就是 全世界
You know, the world...

507
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:07,760
老师 家长 其他孩子
Teachers, parents, other kids.

508
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:09,600
也不完全是内部的
It's not all internal.

509
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:11,380
别误会
Don't get me wrong.

510
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:13,880
我喜欢这种紧张的状态
I like the way I'm wired.

511
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:16,100
只有这样我才能上好学校
It's what's going to get me into a good school.

512
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,740
这才是我
It's what makes me who I am.

513
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:20,400
那感觉怎么样 做你自己
And how is that -- being who you are?

514
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:21,560
我不知道
I don't know.

515
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:23,380
大多数时候还不错
Mostly good.

516
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:25,740
有点累
A little exhausting.

517
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,180
有时候很艰难
Sometimes hard.

518
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:30,900
我觉得这就是你想要的答案吧
I guess there's your answer.

519
00:17:31,580 --> 00:17:34,280
做我自己很难
It's hard being me.

520
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:36,300
再跟我说说你的家庭
Tell me a little more about your family.

521
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,840
就是个很普通的家庭
They're pretty normal, I guess.

522
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:40,320
我跟他们都不太一样
I'm not like any of them,

523
00:17:40,320 --> 00:17:42,820
-但这对我没什么困扰 -从来没有吗
- But that doesn't really bother me. - Ever?

524
00:17:43,380 --> 00:17:46,540
除非他们说"艾丽克斯 你太刻苦了"
Only when they say things like "Alex, you study too much"

525
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:50,540
或是"别紧张" "去玩玩"之类的
or "Don't freak out" or "Go do something fun."

526
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:51,780
就是说你的兄弟姐妹
So, your siblings--

527
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:54,740
他们并没有你那样的压力
they don't experience the same pressures you do.

528
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,660
天呐 当然没有 他们才不在乎学业
Oh, god, no. They don't care about school.

529
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:58,180
你觉得原因是什么呢
Hmm. Why do you think that is?

530
00:17:58,180 --> 00:17:59,840
你们都在同一屋檐下长大
I mean, you all grew up in the same house

531
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:02,580
有着同样的父母 而你却是唯一
with the same parents, yet you're the only one

532
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:04,460
为了达到高标准
who feels this enormous pressure

533
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:06,120
而感到巨大压力的人
to achieve at such a high level.

534
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:07,860
为什么要谈论我的家人
Why do we even have to talk about my family?

535
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,740
他们跟这事没关系
They don't have anything to do with this.

536
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:12,080
他们不懂我
They don't get me.

537
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:14,400
这种感觉如何
How's that feel?

538
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:18,060
-不知道 -你很聪明
- I don't know. - You're a smart girl.

539
00:18:18,060 --> 00:18:20,680
-再好好想想 -我说了不知道
- Try a little harder. - I said I don't know.

540
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,600
我感觉
I feel...

541
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,640
有点孤单
kind of alone.

542
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:36,240
我知道孩子们都忙着准备入学考试
I realize our juniors are busy with SATs, so as a rule,

543
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,440
所以我每晚只布置两个小时的作业量
I only give two hours of homework a night.

544
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:40,960
-两个小时啊 -我们的学生非常棒
- Two hours? - Our students are highly advanced.

545
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,220
他们完全应付得来
It's nothing they can't handle.

546
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:43,960
我相信他们可以
You know, I'm-- I'm sure they can.

547
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,660
只是说他们要上两小时的课
It's just that if they have two hours in this class

548
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:47,543
还要上一小时的生物课
and they have an hour for A.P. Bio

549
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:50,980
还有一个半小时的文学课
and an hour and a half for, um, advanced lit

550
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:51,860
再加上 稍等
and-- hang on one second.

551
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:53,520
我要写在板子上
Let me just do this on the board,

552
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:57,088
两小时一小时再加一个半小时
'cause then it's-- um, we got 2 and 1 and 1.5

553
00:18:57,088 --> 00:18:58,938
之后还有一个半小时
and then another, uh, hour and a half

554
00:18:58,938 --> 00:19:02,948
历史课 算下来
for A.P. History-- gives us...

555
00:19:03,973 --> 00:19:05,280
-六小时 -没错
- It's 6. - Yes!

556
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:07,460
妮娜 我就要算出来了
Nina, I was getting there.

557
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:08,760
谢谢 非常感谢
Thank you! Thank you so much!

558
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:10,060
要是你打字没那么大声
If I could just have a second to think

559
00:19:10,060 --> 00:19:11,540
我就能静下心来计算了
without all the tippy-tappy typing.

560
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:16,700
这下你们高兴了吧
Well, I hope you're happy.

561
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:18,080
你们毁了大家的躲避球赛
You've ruined dodgeball for everyone.

562
00:19:18,380 --> 00:19:20,360
是她把球扔到我脸上的
She was the one who threw that ball in my face.

563
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:22,520
那是因为你色诱英格拉姆老师
Only because you threw yourself at Mr. Ingram.

564
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:23,660
拜托 女士们
Okay, ladies, please.

565
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:24,700
你们看不出你们在干什么吗
Can't you see what's going on here?

566
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:27,340
你们都只是想为孩子争取最好的机会
You both just want what's best for your kids.

567
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:30,080
我得帮韦斯利争取到这次旅行
I need to get this trip for Wesley.

568
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:32,980
我不想再看到他每次都对我生气
I'm tired of him being so mad at me all the time.

569
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:34,200
他为什么生气
Why is he mad?

570
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:36,140
他认为我和他爸离婚是我的错
Oh, he blames me for the divorce.

571
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:37,660
他爸爸总是那个好人
His father will always be the hero.

572
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:40,060
不在身边的人总是不会被责怪
It's hard to blame someone who's never there.

573
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,720
难道你不能理解吗
Now, can't you relate to that?

574
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,800
会好起来的
It will get better.

575
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:47,320
孩子们会明白谁是真正为他们好的
Kids always figure out who's really there for them.

576
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:50,840
对投影仪的事再次表示抱歉
Again, we're very sorry about the projector.

577
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:52,760
我周一会寄来支票
I'll send a check on Monday.

578
00:19:53,120 --> 00:19:55,060
-亲爱的 -我惹事了
- Hi, honey. - I got in trouble.

579
00:19:55,060 --> 00:19:57,229
她的事都记到我的帐上
Whatever she did, add it to my tab.

580
00:19:57,506 --> 00:19:59,646
-好吧 来吧 -不不
- All right, let's do this. - No. No, no, no.

581
00:19:59,646 --> 00:20:02,478
不是你俩 就你 来吧 警长
Not you two, just you. Come on, sheriff.

582
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,120
亲爱的 怎么样
Oh, hey, honey. How did it go?

583
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,960
挺好的 下周继续
Good. And I made another session for next week.

584
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:10,140
学校开放日怎么样
How was the open house?

585
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:11,380
非常紧张
Wow. So intense.

586
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:14,300
我都不知道你承受了那么大的压力
I had no idea the kind of pressure you're under.

587
00:20:14,300 --> 00:20:15,780
亲爱的 我只在学校体验了两个小时
Honey, I was just you for two hours.

588
00:20:15,780 --> 00:20:17,480
就已经快受不了了
I could barely hold it together.

589
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:20,940
你没有每天情绪失控真是太了不起了
I don't know how you don't have a meltdown every day.

590
00:20:20,940 --> 00:20:22,959
-我 -亲爱的
- I... - Oh, honey.

591
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,320
宝贝 怎么了 是我说了什么吗
Sweetie, what? Did I say something?

592
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,420
是的
Yes.

593
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:29,100
谢谢
Thank you.

594
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:30,820
没事
Okay.

595
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:32,540
没事
Okay.

596
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:35,400
乖
Okay.

597
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:48,060
再次抱歉
Again, I am so sorry.

598
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:50,120
现在想来 我过来向你炫耀
I-I guess, in retrospect, it was a little crazy

599
00:20:50,120 --> 00:20:52,680
我的州律师协会奖 实在有点疯狂
that I wanted to show you my state bar association award.

600
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,420
别说了
Stop.

601
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:55,300
可能是我太过激了
And it's possible I come on a little too strong.

602
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:56,920
不不不
No. No, no.

603
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,560
我以为我很环保
I like to think that I'm greener than I am,

604
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:00,280
但也许我只是想
but maybe I just want the credit

605
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:01,820
不像你那样卖力气就得到赞赏
without doing all the hard work that you do.

606
00:21:01,980 --> 00:21:03,220
你说得对 是很不容易
Well, you're right-- it is hard,

607
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:04,820
但也会遭到孤立
but, you know, it's also alienating.

608
00:21:04,820 --> 00:21:06,522
没人想跟我交朋友
You know, no one wants to be friends with me.

609
00:21:06,522 --> 00:21:08,080
我都不记得上次请别人
I-I can't tell you the last time

610
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:09,180
来家里吃饭是什么时候了
I had people over for dinner,

611
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,800
也许这是好事
which is probably a good thing.

612
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:11,800
你知道太阳能嘛
You know, with solar power,

613
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:13,220
需要四天的时间才能烤熟一只鸡
it takes four days to roast a chicken.

614
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:15,380
-真的吗 -如果你想全熟的话
- Really? - If you want it cooked all the way through, yeah.

615
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:17,440
知道我得过三次沙门氏菌病吗
You know I had salmonella three times?

616
00:21:18,580 --> 00:21:19,880
你可以来我家吃饭
If you want to come over to our house for dinner,

617
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,820
-我们欠你的 -你可以玩我的娃娃屋
- we kind of owe you. - You can play with my dollhouse.

618
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:23,480
真的吗
Yeah?

619
00:21:24,023 --> 00:21:26,040
那是可持续材料做的吗
Does it made from sustainable materials?

620
00:21:26,040 --> 00:21:27,040
当我没说
Forget it.
